      "index": 2,
      "text": "Your Trusted Partner in Sustainable Rail Freight",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "SDG Railway provides logistics operators, freight forwarders, and shippers with efficient and sustainable rail transport solutions connecting major ports and inland terminals across Europe. Through its digital management platform, users can plan routes, request quotes, and coordinate intermodal shipments seamlessly.\n\nUnlike traditional rail freight services, SDG Railway operates within a fully integrated digital environment, combining real-time visibility, optimized scheduling, and environmental impact tracking. Each service is designed to reduce transit times, minimize emissions, and enhance transparency across the supply chain.\n\nWith SDG Railway, customers gain access to door-to-terminal and port-to-inland connections, supported by advanced ERP integration and automated documentation tools.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Key Values",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Efficiency\n\nOptimized routes, advanced scheduling, and seamless intermodal coordination ensure that every shipment moves on time and cost-effectively. We are committed to delivering reliable freight services that maximize performance and minimize delays.\n\nSustainability\n\nPowered by electric locomotives and driven by environmental responsibility, we significantly reduce carbon emissions compared to road transport. Each journey contributes to a cleaner, greener logistics network across Europe.\n\nDigital Innovation\n\nThrough smart digital tools and real-time data integration, we enhance transparency, traceability, and decision-making. Innovation is at the core of every operation, creating a more connected and intelligent supply chain.",
      "embeds": [],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Our Services",
